flowchart TB
  subgraph SITE[Customer site]
    P1[Meter Module / Pod 1]
    P2[Meter Module / Pod n]
  end
  AA[Authorization Authority\nissues signed authorization records]
  WIT[Checkpoint Witness\ncountersigns ledger heads]
  VER[Verifier SDK\nanyone with public keys]
  CONS[Consumers: lender portal, auditor,\nbilling system, SIEM, DCIM]
  MCA[Manufacturing CA\nHSM-backed, offline root]
  MCA -. issues pod and tag certs .-> P1
  AA -- AR over telemetry net or token --> P1
  P1 -- checkpoints --> WIT
  WIT -- signed receipts --> P1
  P1 -- record bundles --> CONS
  CONS --> VER
  WIT --> VER
